.TH AMERIKA-FIRST-RUN 1 "2026-10-21" "Amerika OS" "Amerika OS Manual"
.SH NAME
amerika\-first\-run \- one\-time look\-and\-feel setup for the Amerika session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B amerika\-first\-run
.RB [ \-\-force ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run by
.I session\-start
at the beginning of every Amerika session. It writes the window button layout, effects and colour scheme to
.IR kwinrc ,
.I kdeglobals
and the GTK
.I gtk.css
files of the current user, then records the version it applied in
.IR ~/.local/state/amerika\-os/first\-run .
When that marker already holds the current version nothing happens.
.PP
The welcome pages that follow the first login are described by
.IR /usr/share/amerika\-os/welcome/welcome.json .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-force
Apply the settings again even if the marker is up to date.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/amerika\-os/first\-run
Version marker.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR amerika\-settings (1),
.BR amerika\-apply\-defaults (1),
.BR amerika\-flavour (7)
